Based on the information retrieved from the "Cho Natural Farming" document, here is a dataset detailing regenerative farming methods, particularly focusing on Cho's Global Natural Farming techniques and the ingredients used in these methods:

```json
{
  "Natural Farming Methods": {
    "Ingredients": [
      {
        "Type": "Animal Materials",
        "Examples": ["Bone meal", "Fish meal"],
        "Purpose": "Provide abundant proteins"
      },
